msgid "Conversation identity"
msgstr "会話のユーザー情報"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:599
msgid ""
"Sharing identity makes DocsBot conversations non-anonymous. Each field is "
"optional and is sent only after the visitor passes your access rules."
msgstr ""
"ユーザー情報を共有すると DocsBot の会話は匿名ではなくなります。各項目は任意"
"で、訪問者がアクセスルールを満たした後にのみ送信されます。"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:601
msgid "Share display name"
msgstr "表示名を共有"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:602
msgid "Share email address"
msgstr "メールアドレスを共有"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:603
msgid "Share pseudonymous site user ID"
msgstr "仮名化したサイトユーザー ID を共有"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:605
msgid ""
"Review the suggested DocsBot text under Settings → Privacy before enabling "
"identity fields."
msgstr ""
"ユーザー情報を有効にする前に、「設定 → プライバシー」にある DocsBot の推奨文"
"を確認してください。"

